            "verseId": "ISA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi dzulu ya higo, Mtakatifu wa Iziraeli anaamba hivi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mtakatifu wa Iziraeli anaamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli mwimwi atu a Sayuni, yani Jerusalemu tamundarira tsona. Mchiririra kuterywa, andakuonerani mbazi, naye andasikira chiriro chenu, andakujibuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzagbwe Mwenyezi Mlungu nkuapha chakurya chichache agbwiririre wakati wa shida na madzi machache ga kuphunguza chiru bado andaenderera kukala mwalimu wenu namwi mundamuona na matso genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mkagaluka uphande wa kulume au wa kumotso, mundasikira sauti inaamba, “Njira ni hino, igbwireni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu vizuka vyenu vya feza na zahabu mundaviona dza najisi na kuvitsupha dza mademu ga nongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu andahenda mvula inye kpwa ajili ya mbeyu zenu mchizophanda. Minda yenu indavyala mtsere munji na mifugo yenu indaphaha nyasi nyinji za kurisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ndzau na nyo punda a kurimira minda yenu andariswa mtsere uchiokola munyu vinono na uchiophehwato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo atu anji andaolagbwa na minara kubanangbwa, madzi gandajera kula myango mire na vidzango vire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Mwenyezi Mlungu andaafunga bendeji atue ariolumizwa na kuphoza vironda arivyosababisha. Mwezi undaala na mwanga munji avi ni dzuwa, na dzuwa rindalavya mwanga munji kano sabaa zaidi ya kawaida. Indakala avi ni mwanga wa siku sabaa kpwa siku mwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
